{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 49,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.54802703857422,
        470.94293212890625,
        147.1480255126953
      ],
      "text": "2. Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.51710510253906,
        527.4317626953125,
        194.96009826660156
      ],
      "text": "Coverage of contact investigation and TPT among child contacts and people with HIV are two of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        192.4411163330078,
        527.4202880859375,
        208.1601104736328
      ],
      "text": "(8) the top 10 core indicators for monitoring implementation of the End TB Strategy . National TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.91712951660156,
        527.271484375,
        221.36012268066406
      ],
      "text": "and HIV programmes report data yearly to WHO and UNAIDS on progress in PMTPT in target",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.8411407470703,
        527.4098510742188,
        234.5601348876953
      ],
      "text": "(41,130) populations  . PMTPT should include monitoring and evaluation systems that are aligned with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.3170928955078,
        527.3883056640625,
        247.7600860595703
      ],
      "text": "national TB patient monitoring and surveillance systems. They should include coverage of TPT with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.51710510253906,
        527.5335083007812,
        260.9601135253906
      ],
      "text": "levofloxacin among contacts exposed to MDR/RR-TB. Appropriate recording and reporting tools",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.71710205078125,
        527.3992919921875,
        274.1601257324219
      ],
      "text": "should be available. Electronic case-based monitoring will facilitate PMTPT. Standardized indicators",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.9171142578125,
        527.5664672851562,
        287.3601379394531
      ],
      "text": "should be measured regularly to inform decision-makers for programme implementation. Some may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984589576721191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        286.11712646484375,
        527.3815307617188,
        300.5601501464844
      ],
      "text": "require changes to national regulations or health policies (e.g. making TBI a notifiable condition or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.31707763671875,
        527.3975830078125,
        313.7601013183594
      ],
      "text": "mandating a reporting framework), which should be addressed according to the context. The private",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993448257446289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.51708984375,
        527.4367065429688,
        326.9601135253906
      ],
      "text": "health sector should be engaged to ensure proper recording and reporting from both the private",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.71710205078125,
        527.3910522460938,
        340.1601257324219
      ],
      "text": "and public sectors. More details on monitoring and evaluation are provided in the second edition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.64111328125,
        527.4202270507812,
        353.3601379394531
      ],
      "text": "(12) of the WHO operational handbook on TB preventive treatment  . Monitoring should adhere with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.8410949707031,
        241.61669921875,
        366.56011962890625
      ],
      "text": "(131) ethical principles of surveillance .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.8210144042969,
        527.1886596679688,
        388.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "Most individuals who receive TPT are healthy, and adverse reactions to treatment are likely to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.0211181640625,
        527.3948974609375,
        401.4641418457031
      ],
      "text": "influence the likelihood of their completing it. Drug-related toxicity should therefore be minimized.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.22100830078125,
        527.5453491210938,
        414.6640319824219
      ],
      "text": "Medicines used in TPT regimens are generally safe and well tolerated, but adverse reactions have been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957818984985352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.4210205078125,
        527.4202270507812,
        427.8640441894531
      ],
      "text": "observed with isoniazid (particularly asymptomatic elevation of serum liver enzyme concentrations,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.6211242675781,
        527.3827514648438,
        441.06414794921875
      ],
      "text": "peripheral neuropathy and hepatotoxicity), rifampicin and rifapentine (such as cutaneous reactions,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.8210144042969,
        527.6412963867188,
        454.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "hypersensitivity reactions, gastrointestinal intolerance and hepatotoxicity) and levofloxacin (such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.7451171875,
        527.4891967773438,
        467.4641418457031
      ],
      "text": "(124–126) as arthritis, arthralgia, or tendinopathy)  . While most of these reactions are minor and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.22100830078125,
        527.4412841796875,
        480.6640319824219
      ],
      "text": "occur rarely, attention should be paid to preventing conditions such as drug-induced hepatotoxicity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.4210205078125,
        527.3858642578125,
        493.8640441894531
      ],
      "text": "Caregivers should be aware of the spectrum of adverse reactions associated with use of the drugs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.6211242675781,
        527.3738403320312,
        507.06414794921875
      ],
      "text": "so that they can take action rapidly. Most reactions are minor and self-limiting, and severe or serious",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.821044921875,
        212.67730712890625,
        520.2640380859375
      ],
      "text": "reactions occur less commonly.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660659790039,
        527.5250244140625,
        527.4363403320312,
        541.968017578125
      ],
      "text": "Close monitoring for adverse events and of adherence to treatment is essential for people on TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660659790039,
        540.7249755859375,
        527.3140258789062,
        555.16796875
      ],
      "text": "for MDR/RR-TB. The GDG reiterated that strict clinical observation and close monitoring for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660659790039,
        553.925048828125,
        527.4323120117188,
        568.3680419921875
      ],
      "text": "disease, based on sound clinical practice and national guidelines, is required for at least 1 year after",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660659790039,
        567.125,
        527.42041015625,
        581.5679931640625
      ],
      "text": "exposure to MDR/RR-TB, regardless of whether TPT was given. Consideration should also be given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660659790039,
        580.3250122070312,
        408.0360107421875,
        594.7680053710938
      ],
      "text": "to interactions with other medicines when providing TPT for MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660659790039,
        602.0289306640625,
        527.4345703125,
        616.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "Individuals on TPT should be monitored routinely at monthly encounters with health-care providers,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.2288818359375,
        527.2842407226562,
        629.671875
      ],
      "text": "who should explain risk, how TB disease develops and the rationale for the treatment and emphasize",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994098663330078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.4288940429688,
        527.4223022460938,
        642.8718872070312
      ],
      "text": "the importance of completing it. They should also be advised to contact their health-care provider",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.62890625,
        527.2470092773438,
        656.0718994140625
      ],
      "text": "at any time if they become aware of symptoms such as anorexia, nausea, vomiting, abdominal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.8289184570312,
        527.0785522460938,
        669.2719116210938
      ],
      "text": "discomfort, persistent fatigue or weakness, inflamed or torn tendons, muscle pain, difficulty in walking,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969106674194336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.0289306640625,
        527.1163940429688,
        682.471923828125
      ],
      "text": "paraesthesia, burning pain, dark-coloured urine, pale stools, jaundice, confusion or drowsiness,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.2288818359375,
        527.5927734375,
        695.671875
      ],
      "text": "depression, problems with memory, sleeping, vision and hearing, and altered taste and smell. If",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.4288940429688,
        527.4315795898438,
        708.8718872070312
      ],
      "text": "a health-care provider cannot be consulted at the onset of such symptoms, treatment should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.62890625,
        527.5610961914062,
        722.0718994140625
      ],
      "text": "stopped immediately. This is a critical area in which front-line health-care workers and students should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976574897766113,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.8289184570312,
        143.28659057617188,
        735.2719116210938
      ],
      "text": "receive training.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        742.5327758789062,
        527.4090576171875,
        756.9757690429688
      ],
      "text": "There is insufficient evidence to support systematic testing of baseline liver function in people on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        754.456787109375,
        527.4085693359375,
        770.17578125
      ],
      "text": "(132) regimens containing isoniazid and/or rifamycins  . This is, however, strongly encouraged, where",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        545.8001708984375,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "31",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}